# Architecture & State Rules

## Framework

- Next.js App Router
- Client Components for interaction
- No premature Server Actions

## State Management

Phase 1 state MUST use:
- PostsContext (StudyPost + AIResult)
- AppContext (subjects, courses, quiz cache)

Rules:
- No direct cross-context mutation
- No global singleton state
- Context = in-memory ONLY

## Data Flow

UI → Context → UI

Forbidden:
- UI directly calling AI logic without Context
- AI writing directly into UI state
